{"id": "cc38dcf5-8a76-4266-9549-677e5a06cead", "slug": "neurovox-neural-audio-engine", "title": "NeuroVox - Neural Audio Engine", "description": "Neurovox Neural Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"NeuroVox - Neural Audio Engine\"\ndescription: \"Neurovox Neural Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#EA580C\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#BE123C\"\n  background: \"#09090B\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# NeuroVox - Neural Audio Engine\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 166; favorites: 6; remixes: 3.\nTags: background, animated, threejs, effect, webgl.\n## Overview\nNeurovox Neural Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nNEUROVOX ° Engine Use Cases API About Documentation Log in Next-Gen Voice Synthesis Speak Fluently. Without Limits. Absolute Scale. Produce hyper-realistic voice models on demand, capturing unique vocal nuances with inc…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Speak Fluently. Without Limits. Absolute Scale.; Real-Time Streaming; Voice Replication; Production Grade.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #EA580C, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #BE123C, background #09090B, surface #191C21, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NeuroVox - Neural Audio Engine</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"antialiased text-gray-100 bg-[#09090b] overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-orange-500/30 selection:text-orange-200\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Effect Container -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-y-0 right-0 w-[120vw] md:w-[70vw] translate-x-[10%] md:translate-x-0 z-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #18181b 0%, #000000 100%);\">\n\n        <!-- Central Glowing Aura -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 m-auto w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-white/5 blur-[120px] rounded-full scale-75 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- 2D Canvas Network Visualization -->\n        <canvas id=\"network-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Glass Slices Overlay (Ethereal Materiality Remix) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex pointer-events-none\">\n            <!-- Slice 1: Seamless blend with dark body background -->\n            <div class=\"h-full flex-[1.2] relative border-l border-transparent\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #09090b 0%, rgba(9,9,11,0) 100%);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Slice 2 -->\n            <div class=\"h-full flex-1 relative border-l border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-[2px]\" style=\"box-shadow: -15px 0 30px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Slice 3 -->\n            <div class=\"h-full flex-1 relative border-l border-white/5 bg-white/[0.04] backdrop-blur-[4px]\" style=\"box-shadow: -15px 0 30px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Slice 4 -->\n            <div class=\"h-full flex-1 relative border-l border-white/5 bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-md\" style=\"box-shadow: -15px 0 30px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Slice 5 -->\n            <div class=\"h-full flex-1 relative border-l border-white/5 bg-white/[0.08] backdrop-blur-lg\" style=\"box-shadow: -15px 0 30px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Floating Data Indicators Layer -->\n        <div id=\"floating-indicators\" class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none w-full h-full origin-center z-10\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[88rem] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 flex flex-col min-h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-8 anim-element\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-lg font-normal tracking-tight text-white uppercase\">\n                NEUROVOX<span class=\"text-[#ea580c] text-xl leading-none\">°</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10 text-sm font-normal text-gray-400\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Engine</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Use Cases</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">API</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">About</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <div>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Log in</a>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center max-w-2xl pt-16 pb-24\">\n\n            <!-- Badge -->\n            <div class=\"anim-element mb-8 w-max inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-normal text-orange-400 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] backdrop-blur-md\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(8px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 8px); border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(20,10,5,0.6), rgba(20,10,5,0.6)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, #ea580c, #be123c) border-box; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:microphone-3-linear\" class=\"text-base\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                Next-Gen Voice Synthesis\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline with Masked Reveal -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl text-white leading-[1.05] font-light tracking-tight gs-reveal-container\">\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"gs-reveal-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform\">Speak</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"gs-reveal-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform\">Fluently.</span></span><br>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"gs-reveal-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform\">Without</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"gs-reveal-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform\">Limits.</span></span><br>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1 pt-1\"><span class=\"gs-reveal-word translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ea580c] to-[#e11d48]\">Absolute Scale.</span></span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Subheadline -->\n            <p class=\"anim-element mt-7 text-base md:text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed max-w-[28rem]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); transition-delay: 0.3s;\">\n                Produce hyper-realistic voice models on demand, capturing unique vocal nuances with incredible precision. Embed seamlessly into applications, media, and interactive interfaces. Fast. Private. Commercial-ready.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTA Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"anim-element mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); transition-delay: 0.4s;\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-normal text-[#09090b] hover:bg-gray-200 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(12px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 12px), calc(100% - 12px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 12px);\">\n                    Deploy your model\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lg opacity-80\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-md px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-normal text-orange-400 hover:text-orange-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(12px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 12px), calc(100% - 12px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 12px); border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(rgba(30,15,5,0.6), rgba(30,15,5,0.6)) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, #ea580c, #be123c) border-box;\">\n                    Talk to Sales\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Features Row -->\n        <div class=\"anim-element pb-12 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-10 sm:gap-14 border-t border-transparent\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); transition-delay: 0.5s;\">\n\n            <!-- Feature 1 -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-default\">\n                <div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(8px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 8px);\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-100\">Real-Time Streaming</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5\">Zero-latency synthesis</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Feature 2 -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-default\">\n                <div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(8px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 8px);\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:soundwave-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-100\">Voice Replication</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5\">Studio-quality accuracy</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Feature 3 -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-default\">\n                <div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(8px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 8px);\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm font-normal text-gray-100\">Production Grade</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5\">Guaranteed 99.9% uptime</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Network Engine and Animations -->\n    <script>\n        // --- 3D Network Visualization (Aura Depth-Aware System) ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('network-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n        let width, height, centerX, centerY;\n\n        function resizeCanvas() {\n            width = canvas.clientWidth;\n            height = canvas.clientHeight;\n            canvas.width = width * window.devicePixelRatio;\n            canvas.height = height * window.devicePixelRatio;\n            ctx.scale(window.devicePixelRatio, window.devicePixelRatio);\n            // Offset center slightly to the right to fit layout balance\n            centerX = width * 0.6;\n            centerY = height * 0.5;\n        }\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);\n        resizeCanvas();\n\n        // Spherical projection math\n        const nodes = [];\n        const numNodes = 140;\n        for(let i = 0; i < numNodes; i++) {\n            let phi = Math.acos(-1 + (2 * i) / numNodes);\n            let theta = Math.sqrt(numNodes * Math.PI) * phi;\n            nodes.push({\n                x: Math.cos(theta) * Math.sin(phi),\n                y: Math.sin(theta) * Math.sin(phi),\n                z: Math.cos(phi),\n                baseSize: 1 + Math.random() * 1.5,\n                pulseOffset: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Floating DOM Overlays\n        const indicatorsData = [\n            { id: 'ind-chip', nodeIdx: 24, type: 'chip', label: '48.2 TB/s' },\n            { id: 'ind-callout', nodeIdx: 58, type: 'callout', label: 'Linking Cores' },\n            { id: 'ind-status', nodeIdx: 92, type: 'status' },\n            { id: 'ind-avatar', nodeIdx: 115, type: 'avatar', src: 'https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=33' }\n        ];\n\n        const indicatorsContainer = document.getElementById('floating-indicators');\n        indicatorsData.forEach(ind => {\n            const el = document.createElement('div');\n            el.className = 'absolute top-0 left-0 pointer-events-auto flex items-center justify-center hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-150 ease-out cursor-default';\n\n            if (ind.type === 'chip') {\n                el.innerHTML = `<div class=\"bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-normal text-white tracking-wide shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] whitespace-nowrap\">\n                    ${ind.label}\n                </div>`;\n            } else if (ind.type === 'status') {\n                el.innerHTML = `<div class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                    <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-white opacity-75\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-white shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]\"></span>\n                </div>`;\n            } else if (ind.type === 'callout') {\n                el.innerHTML = `<div class=\"relative bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-2 px-3 text-xs font-normal text-gray-200 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] whitespace-nowrap flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -left-1.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3 h-3 bg-[#18181b] border-l border-b border-white/10 rotate-45 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:transmission-linear\" class=\"text-white text-sm\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    ${ind.label}\n                </div>`;\n            } else if (ind.type === 'avatar') {\n                el.innerHTML = `<div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/10 overflow-hidden bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)]\">\n                    <img src=\"${ind.src}\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-80\" alt=\"Node Entity\" />\n                </div>`;\n            }\n            indicatorsContainer.appendChild(el);\n            ind.el = el;\n        });\n\n        // Main Render Loop\n        function draw(time) {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            const R = Math.min(width, height) * 0.4; // Sphere radius\n            const angleY = time * 0.00025;\n            const floatY = Math.sin(time * 0.00314) * 15; // 2000ms drift cycle\n\n            // Matrix projection\n            const transformed = nodes.map((n, i) => {\n                let xProj = n.x * Math.cos(angleY) + n.z * Math.sin(angleY);\n                let zProj = -n.x * Math.sin(angleY) + n.z * Math.cos(angleY);\n                return { ...n, xProj, zProj, origIdx: i };\n            });\n\n            // Sort by depth mapping\n            transformed.sort((a, b) => a.zProj - b.zProj);\n\n            // Render Connectivity Lines\n            ctx.lineWidth = 0.6;\n            for(let i=0; i<transformed.length; i++) {\n                for(let j=i+1; j<transformed.length; j++) {\n                    const a = transformed[i];\n                    const b = transformed[j];\n                    const dx = a.xProj - b.xProj;\n                    const dy = a.y - b.y;\n                    const dz = a.zProj - b.zProj;\n                    const distSq = dx*dx + dy*dy + dz*dz;\n\n                    if (distSq < 0.16) {\n                        const avgZ = (a.zProj + b.zProj) / 2;\n                        if (avgZ > -0.6) {\n                            const alpha = Math.min(1, (avgZ + 0.6) * 1.5) * (1 - Math.sqrt(distSq)/0.4);\n                            ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${alpha * 0.35})`;\n                            ctx.beginPath();\n                            ctx.moveTo(centerX + a.xProj * R, centerY + a.y * R + floatY);\n                            ctx.lineTo(centerX + b.xProj * R, centerY + b.y * R + floatY);\n                            ctx.stroke();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Render Nodes\n            transformed.forEach(n => {\n                const alpha = Math.max(0.05, Math.min(1, (n.zProj + 0.8) * 1.2));\n                const pulse = Math.sin(time * 0.003 + n.pulseOffset) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                const size = n.baseSize + pulse * 1.2;\n\n                ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${alpha * 0.9})`;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(centerX + n.xProj * R, centerY + n.y * R + floatY, size * (alpha * 0.5 + 0.5), 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fill();\n            });\n\n            // Sync Spatial DOM Overlays\n            indicatorsData.forEach(ind => {\n                const n = transformed.find(t => t.origIdx === ind.nodeIdx);\n                if (n) {\n                    const screenX = centerX + n.xProj * R;\n                    const screenY = centerY + n.y * R + floatY;\n                    const scale = Math.max(0.6, Math.min(1.2, n.zProj * 0.5 + 1));\n                    const alpha = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (n.zProj + 0.5) * 2));\n\n                    ind.el.style.transform = `translate3d(${screenX}px, ${screenY}px, 0) scale(${scale}) translate(-50%, -50%)`;\n                    ind.el.style.opacity = alpha;\n                    ind.el.style.zIndex = Math.round(n.zProj * 100) + 100;\n                    ind.el.style.pointerEvents = alpha > 0.5 ? 'auto' : 'none';\n                }\n            });\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n        requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n\n        // --- GSAP Masked Reveal & Standard Entrance Animations ---\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Headline Masked Reveal\n            gsap.to('.gs-reveal-word', {\n                y: '0%',\n                ease: 'power4.out',\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: '.gs-reveal-container',\n                    start: 'top 85%',\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Standard opacity fades\n            const elements = document.querySelectorAll('.anim-element');\n            elements.forEach((el, index) => {\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    el.style.opacity = '1';\n                    el.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\n                }, 100 + (index * 80));\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "neurovox-neural-audio-engine.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/neurovox-neural-audio-engine.jpg", "source_name": "neurovox-neural-audio-engine-DESIGN.md", "views": 293, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T12:58:51.361629+00:00"}